<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About page</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/About.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="heroContainer">
        <div class="musicCard">
            <img src="~/images/music.jpg" alt="Vinyl record" class="musicPicture" />

            <h1 class="cardName">Musical preferences</h1>
            <p class="musicDescription">
                "Where words fail, music speaks." — Hans Christian Andersen
            </p>

            <a href="https://localhost:7287/favourites/favourite/music" class="btnPrimary" target="_parent">See music</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="heroContainer">
        <div class="gamesCard">
            <img src="~/images/games.jpg" alt="PS cover" class="gamesPicture" />

            <h1 class="cardName">Favourite games</h1>
            <p class="gameDescription">
                "I survived because the fire inside burned brighter than the fire around me." 
                – Joshua Graham (Fallout: New Vegas)
            </p>

            <a href="https://localhost:7287/favourites/favourite/games" class="btnPrimary" target="_parent">See games</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="heroContainer">
        <div class="moviesCard">
            <img src="~/images/movies.jpg" alt="movies" class="moviesPicture" />

            <h1 class="cardName">Movies that i like</h1>
            <p class="movieDescription">
                "No mistakes in the tango, not like life... you just tango on"
                – Scent of a woman.
            </p>

            <a href="https://localhost:7287/favourites/favourite/movies" class="btnPrimary" target="_parent">See movies</a>
        </div>
    </div>
